scene "A decision series whose journal keeps only its two latest entries.";

claim ok;
evidence tool from "a tool result";
renewable tool limit 8;
decisions verdict limit 8;
journal window 2;

event read;
event decide;
event redo;

on read when observed(tool) renew tool;
on read reveal tool supports ok;
on decide commit verdict because enough using 1;
on redo reopen verdict because tool;
